WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.302
A central finding of the analysis is that more data
does not rescue maximum likelihood.

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:08.890
Even in the high data regime it keeps making bad mistakes,

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.488
choosing actions outside the epsilon ball,

00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:16.870
because expert only data leaves large parts of the
state and action space unexplored no

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.097
matter how many episodes we collect.

00:00:19.177 --> 00:00:24.664
Sweeping the optimality level from zero through
four confirms that our method holds across

00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:26.458
degrees of expert optimality,

00:00:26.538 --> 00:00:31.840
recovering policies that can even beat the expert
while keeping variance close to zero.
